1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,467
Free demo, and it's the sequel to Hellcard,
from the Book of Demons studio.

2
00:00:04,617 --> 00:00:08,300
The whole dungeon is made of paper,
and it pops up out of a book.

3
00:00:08,450 --> 00:00:12,603
You and your friends fight back-to-back
in the middle of a circle of monsters.

4
00:00:12,753 --> 00:00:16,802
Everything you do is a card.
Attack, block, burn.

5
00:00:16,952 --> 00:00:24,214
Between fights you get little story rooms. A campfire,
a cracked eggshell, a sarcophagus you probably shouldn't open.

6
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:28,988
The catch? The trailer barely shows the combat.
About five seconds of it.

7
00:00:29,138 --> 00:00:35,094
The demo is nearly five gigs, in thirteen languages,
and the full game is due in twenty twenty-seven.

8
00:00:35,244 --> 00:00:39,110
Think Slay the Spire,
with friends and a lot of dragons.

9
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,794
Worth a dip if paper
monsters are your thing.

10
00:00:41,944 --> 00:00:43,041
That's Demo Dip.
